-# Soft delete (DECISIONS.md:54). The sentence below is the whole reason this
-# is a dialog: what the teacher is about to remove is the sheet, not the
-# currency it handed out, and there is no way to take that back anyway.
%h2#gh-del-title.gh-h2= "Usunąć arkusz „#{activity_group.name}”?"
%p Arkusz zniknie z listy, a przyznane nagrody zostają u studentów i w ich historii.

- if awards_count.positive?
  %p.gh-info
    %i.fa-solid.fa-lock{ 'aria-hidden': 'true' }
    %span
      = "Przyznano z niego #{awards_count} #{gh_plural(awards_count, 'nagrodę', 'nagrody', 'nagród')}."
      Usunięcie arkusza niczego nie cofa.

.gh-dlg-b
  - if @in_modal
    %button.gh-btn.gh-btn--sec{ type: 'button', data: { action: 'dialog#close' }, autofocus: true }
      Anuluj
  - else
    = link_to 'Anuluj', edit_story_group_activity_group_path(@story_group, activity_group),
      class: 'gh-btn gh-btn--sec'

  = button_to 'Usuń arkusz', story_group_activity_group_path(@story_group, activity_group),
    method: :delete, class: 'gh-btn',
    form: { data: { turbo_frame: (@in_modal ? 'modal' : nil) } }
